    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/5cb6ba0407354dc438b0e069ef908eb1.poster.avif?t=1755673503\" width=1600 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/5cb6ba0407354dc438b0e069ef908eb1.webm?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO KNOWS YOU BEST?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The You Quiz\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>multiplayer party game</strong>\u00a0designed for <strong>3 to 8 players</strong>. <br>Perfect for game nights with friends or family, it also works great as an icebreaker at social gatherings!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ASYMMETRICAL PARTY GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player gets to be the King. Everyone else? Courtiers desperate for approval.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE COURTIER'S TASK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/70b4e2e2fab985d3a457fe8d89ca4161.poster.avif?t=1755673503\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/70b4e2e2fab985d3a457fe8d89ca4161.webm?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/70b4e2e2fab985d3a457fe8d89ca4161.mp4?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess the King\u2019s opinion on personal, weird, or hilarious prompts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhat's King's unpopular opinion?\u201d<br>\u201cIt's the end of the world. What is King's first reaction?\u201d<br>\u201cName three things King hates:\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/9d1f8eb6f78967f045e3a9853d98b741.poster.avif?t=1755673503\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/9d1f8eb6f78967f045e3a9853d98b741.webm?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/9d1f8eb6f78967f045e3a9853d98b741.mp4?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better know your friend! Answer with insight, flattery, or playful nonsense. Whatever makes them feel seen, smile, laugh, or glow with pride.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE KING DECIDES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/0735fb1d2efe3cd672e9f86cca5dd21d.poster.avif?t=1755673503\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/0735fb1d2efe3cd672e9f86cca5dd21d.webm?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/0735fb1d2efe3cd672e9f86cca5dd21d.mp4?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the King, you judge every answer:<br>\ud83d\udc4e Meh? Reject it.<br>\ud83d\udc4d Pretty good? One step forward.<br>\u2764\ufe0f Nailed it? Two steps up the stairs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/788dac0ead919b4b1e5a515eb44e6b16.poster.avif?t=1755673503\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/788dac0ead919b4b1e5a515eb44e6b16.webm?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/788dac0ead919b4b1e5a515eb44e6b16.mp4?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your court, your rules. Reward brilliance. Punish mediocrity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DETHRONE THE KING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/988a71802cd186ccfb2c2c0e3e2c9df3.poster.avif?t=1755673503\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/988a71802cd186ccfb2c2c0e3e2c9df3.webm?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/988a71802cd186ccfb2c2c0e3e2c9df3.mp4?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First to reach the top of the stairs steals the crown. Then they become the new King!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR TITLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each game, players earn titles that match their vibe.<br>Were you the <i><strong>Don Juan</strong></i>? The <i><strong>Emperor</strong></i>? The <i><strong>Jealous</strong></i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 30+ titles! Bragging rights included.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY IT ONLINE OR ON THE COUCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e9ec1355bfa80f6594acae0412d48e30.poster.avif?t=1755673503\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e9ec1355bfa80f6594acae0412d48e30.webm?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e9ec1355bfa80f6594acae0412d48e30.mp4?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick and easy to set up, <strong>The You Quiz\u00a0</strong>is perfect for livening up any game night with friends or family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it locally on the couch, using your phone or tablet as a controller. Or play it online with <strong>only one copy required</strong> (your friends can use the <u><strong>free</strong></u> friend pass).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS FUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 1,000 personal questions, every game is different! </p>",
