d.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e9ec1355bfa80f6594acae0412d48e30.poster.avif?t=1755673503\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e9ec1355bfa80f6594acae0412d48e30.webm?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e9ec1355bfa80f6594acae0412d48e30.mp4?t=1755673503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick and easy to set up, <strong>The You Quiz\u00a0</strong>is perfect for livening up any game night with friends or family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it locally on the couch, using your phone or tablet as a controller. Or play it online with <strong>only one copy required</strong> (your friends can use the <u><strong>free</strong></u> friend pass).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS FUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 1,000 personal questions, every game is different! </p>",
